# google-services.json contains Firebase project credentials and must never be committed.
# Obtain the real file from Firebase Console → Project Settings → Android app (com.esparex.mobile).
# Place it at apps/mobile/android/app/google-services.json (gitignored, not tracked).
# A safe placeholder documenting the required shape is at:
#   apps/mobile/android/app/google-services.json.example  (this file IS tracked)
google-services.json
**/google-services.json

